        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/wtfgamer/{size}/2013_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-09T18:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I found that cut off to be curious. What is the point of it? Unless you happen to be checking the site on the day it was posted you miss out?</p><p>I was a day late, but I checked the link and found the form was still active. I put in my credit card data and got an automated response that tthe payment had been made. I was hoping to print out and try the Sentinels Tactics stuff this weekend because I have time for it. That is why I seem impatient. After sending my money I got no feedback and was wondering If I had done anything wrong or was looking in the wrong places. That is all.</p><p>I hope to hear something on Monday.&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the feedback Greywind.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
